      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://hai.stanford.edu/ai-index/2025-ai-index-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stanford HAI — 2025 AI Index Report</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/the-plunging-price-of-thought\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — The plunging price of thought</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/near-daily-ai-use-doubled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Near-daily AI use among US adults has more than doubled</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/estimating-the-agent-population\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Estimating the agent population</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/research/demystifying-evals-for-ai-agents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic — Demystifying evals for AI agents</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../epoch-ai/index.md\">Epoch AI folder</a> · <a href=\"../anthropic-news/index.md\">Anthropic News</a></li>\n</ul>",
