      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/ai-computing-capacity-additions-doubling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — New global AI computing capacity is doubling every 9 months</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/frontier-data-center-power\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Frontier data-center power records</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/the-plunging-price-of-thought\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — The plunging price of thought</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/latest/introducing-the-ai-chip-imports-explorer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — AI Chip Imports explorer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/will-financing-bottleneck-ai-compute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Will financing bottleneck AI compute?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publications/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — publications hub</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hai.stanford.edu/ai-index/2025-ai-index-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stanford HAI — 2025 AI Index Report</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../epoch-ai/index.md\">Epoch AI folder</a> · <a href=\"../cset-georgetown/index.md\">CSET Georgetown</a></li>\n</ul>",
