      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/eci-bayesian-methodology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — ECI Bayesian methodology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/gpt-4-longest-eci-lead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — GPT-4’s longest ECI lead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/eci-frontier-trend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — ECI frontier trend since reasoning models</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/open-closed-cyber-eci-gap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Open vs closed cyber capability gap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/research/eval-awareness-browsecomp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic — Eval awareness in BrowseComp</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publication/open-models-soft-power-and-the-spectrum-of-u-s-china-artificial-intelligence-competition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — Open models as soft power</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hai.stanford.edu/ai-index/2025-ai-index-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stanford HAI — 2025 AI Index Report</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../epoch-ai/index.md\">Epoch AI folder</a> · <a href=\"../agent-benchmarks/index.md\">agent-benchmarks</a></li>\n</ul>",
