      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://hai.stanford.edu/ai-index/2025-ai-index-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stanford HAI — 2025 AI Index Report</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/near-daily-ai-use-doubled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Near-daily AI use among US adults has more than doubled</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/one-in-five-workers-delegate-work-to-ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — One in five US workers delegates tasks to AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/employer-provided-ai-by-occupation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Most workplace AI use rides free plans</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/biorxiv-llms-vs-ai-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Science preprint AI acknowledgment trends</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://research.google/blog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Research Blog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/blog/back-in-the-chat-california-and-new-york-take-diverging-paths-in-second-wave-of-chatbot-regulations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Chatbot legislation second wave</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../epoch-ai/index.md\">Epoch AI folder</a> · <a href=\"../google-research-blog/index.md\">Google Research Blog</a> · <a href=\"../ieee-spectrum-ai/index.md\">IEEE Spectrum AI</a></li>\n</ul>",
