      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://hai.stanford.edu/ai-index/2025-ai-index-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stanford HAI — 2025 AI Index Report</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/eci-frontier-trend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — ECI frontier trend since reasoning models</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/the-plunging-price-of-thought\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — The plunging price of thought</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/gradient-updates/will-financing-bottleneck-ai-compute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Will financing bottleneck AI compute?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/an-update-on-independent-evaluators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic — An update on independent evaluators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/institute/measuring-pace-of-ai-development\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic — Measuring the pace of AI development inside labs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publication/open-models-soft-power-and-the-spectrum-of-u-s-china-artificial-intelligence-competition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — Open models as soft power</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../epoch-ai/index.md\">Epoch AI folder</a> · <a href=\"../anthropic-news/index.md\">Anthropic News</a></li>\n</ul>",
