      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/ai-computing-capacity-additions-doubling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — AI computing capacity additions doubling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/frontier-data-center-power\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Frontier data-center power records</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/tpu-production-doubling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Broadcom TPU shipment doubling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/latest/scaling-ai-data-centers-research\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Scaling AI data-centers research</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hai.stanford.edu/ai-index/2025-ai-index-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stanford HAI — 2025 AI Index Report</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://spectrum.ieee.org/topic/artificial-intelligence/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IEEE Spectrum — Artificial Intelligence topic</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../epoch-ai/index.md\">Epoch AI folder</a> · <a href=\"../nvidia-technical-blog/index.md\">NVIDIA Technical Blog</a></li>\n</ul>",
