      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publication/open-models-soft-power-and-the-spectrum-of-u-s-china-artificial-intelligence-competition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — Open models as soft power</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/open-closed-cyber-eci-gap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Open vs closed cyber capability gap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/open-weight-models-patch-gap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Open-weight patch-gap / exploit timing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/how-do-chinese-ai-companies-make-money\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — How Chinese AI companies make money</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hai.stanford.edu/ai-index/2025-ai-index-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stanford HAI — 2025 AI Index Report</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/distillation-defenses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic — Distillation defenses</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../cset-georgetown/index.md\">CSET Georgetown</a> · <a href=\"../epoch-ai/index.md\">Epoch AI folder</a></li>\n</ul>",
