      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/latest/introducing-the-ai-chip-imports-explorer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — AI Chip Imports explorer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/chip-performance-per-dollar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Chip performance per dollar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/china-us-semiconductor-supply-chain-exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — China semiconductor supply-chain exposure</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/chip-smuggling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Chip smuggling estimates</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/estimating-the-agent-population\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — Estimating the agent population</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publications/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — publications hub</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://spectrum.ieee.org/fanless-liquid-cooled-ai-servers-coolit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IEEE Spectrum — Fanless liquid-cooled AI servers</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../epoch-ai/index.md\">Epoch AI folder</a> · <a href=\"../cset-georgetown/index.md\">CSET Georgetown</a> · <a href=\"../nvidia-technical-blog/index.md\">NVIDIA Technical Blog</a></li>\n</ul>",
