      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NIST — AI Risk Management Framework</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/article/unpacking-the-white-house-national-policy-framework-for-ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — Unpacking the White House National Policy Framework for AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/blog/back-in-the-chat-california-and-new-york-take-diverging-paths-in-second-wave-of-chatbot-regulations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Chatbot legislation second wave</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/blog/fpf-submits-comments-to-inform-colorado-automated-decision-making-adm-act-rulemaking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Colorado ADM Act comments</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/an-update-on-independent-evaluators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic — An update on independent evaluators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hai.stanford.edu/ai-index/2025-ai-index-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stanford HAI — 2025 AI Index Report</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../fpf/index.md\">FPF</a> · <a href=\"../cset-georgetown/index.md\">CSET Georgetown</a> · <a href=\"privacy-adm-and-chatbot-legislation.md\">privacy/ADM article</a></li>\n</ul>",
