      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/oj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">EUR-Lex — Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 (AI Act)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/regulatory-framework-ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">European Commission — Regulatory framework for AI (AI Act)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/article/eu-ai-code-safety\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — AI Safety under the EU AI Code of Practice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publication/ai-governance-at-the-frontier\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — AI Governance at the Frontier</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NIST — AI Risk Management Framework</a> (crosswalk thinking for GDPR/product-safety overlaps)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hai.stanford.edu/ai-index/2025-ai-index-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stanford HAI — 2025 AI Index Report</a> (governance chapter context)</li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../cset-georgetown/index.md\">CSET Georgetown</a> · <a href=\"comparing-ai-governance-regimes.md\">comparing regimes</a></li>\n</ul>",
