      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publication/china-government-ai-model-use-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — China government AI model-use guidelines</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/article/an-analysis-of-chinas-ai-governance-proposals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — Analysis of China’s AI governance proposals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publication/open-models-soft-power-and-the-spectrum-of-u-s-china-artificial-intelligence-competition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — Open models as soft power</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publication/chinas-embodied-ai-a-path-to-agi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — China’s embodied AI path</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/how-do-chinese-ai-companies-make-money\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — How Chinese AI companies make money</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/latest/introducing-the-ai-chip-imports-explorer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — AI Chip Imports explorer</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../cset-georgetown/index.md\">CSET Georgetown</a> · <a href=\"../epoch-ai/index.md\">Epoch AI folder</a> · <a href=\"comparing-ai-governance-regimes.md\">comparing regimes</a></li>\n</ul>",
