      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/blog/fpf-submits-comments-to-inform-colorado-automated-decision-making-adm-act-rulemaking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Colorado ADM Act comments</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/blog/back-in-the-chat-california-and-new-york-take-diverging-paths-in-second-wave-of-chatbot-regulations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Chatbot legislation second wave</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FPF-U.S.-Chatbot-Regulations-Report-R3.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Regulating the Conversation (chatbot report)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/blog/what-gets-measured-gets-governed-benchmarking-privacy-in-frontier-ai-development-and-deployment/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Benchmarking privacy in frontier AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/blog/defining-agentic-why-we-need-a-shared-taxonomy-for-ai-agents/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Defining “Agentic”</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/blog/its-just-math-recent-legislative-trend-reignites-debate-about-the-bounds-of-biometric-data/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Biometric data definition fights</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../fpf/index.md\">FPF folder</a> · <a href=\"us-frameworks-nist-and-federal-preemption.md\">US frameworks article</a></li>\n</ul>",
