      "sources_html": "<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.swebench.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SWE-bench</a> (incl. Verified / live leaderboard variants as published)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/research/demystifying-evals-for-ai-agents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic — Demystifying evals for AI agents</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/an-update-on-independent-evaluators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic — An update on independent evaluators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/research/eval-awareness-browsecomp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic — Eval awareness in BrowseComp</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/benchmarks/mirrorcode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — MirrorCode</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/publications/the-plunging-price-of-thought\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epoch AI — The plunging price of thought</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fpf.org/blog/what-gets-measured-gets-governed-benchmarking-privacy-in-frontier-ai-development-and-deployment/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FPF — Benchmarking privacy in frontier AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cset.georgetown.edu/publication/systematizing-the-reporting-of-ai-red-teaming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSET — Systematizing the reporting of AI red-teaming</a></li>\n<li>Sibling teaching: <a href=\"../anthropic-news/index.md\">Anthropic News</a> · <a href=\"../fpf/index.md\">FPF</a> · <a href=\"leaderboard-limits-and-failure-modes.md\">leaderboard limits</a></li>\n</ul>",
